<view class="page"><view class="form-intro card"><view class="form-title">新建检测订单</view><view class="muted">先建立车辆档案，再选择检测业务</view></view><view class="card form-card"><view class="field"><text>品牌 / 车型 <text class="required">*</text></text><input placeholder="例如：2021款 丰田 凯美瑞" data-field="brandModel" value="{{vehicle.brandModel}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>车牌号码</text><input placeholder="请输入车牌号" data-field="plate" value="{{vehicle.plate}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>车辆识别代号 VIN</text><input placeholder="17位车辆识别代号" maxlength="17" data-field="vin" value="{{vehicle.vin}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>首次上牌日期</text><input placeholder="YYYY-MM-DD" data-field="firstRegister" value="{{vehicle.firstRegister}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>表显里程（公里）</text><input type="digit" placeholder="请输入里程数" data-field="mileage" value="{{vehicle.mileage}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>车身颜色</text><input placeholder="例如：珍珠白" data-field="color" value="{{vehicle.color}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>委托方 / 送检人</text><input placeholder="选填" data-field="seller" value="{{vehicle.seller}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field last"><text>备注</text><textarea placeholder="车辆特殊情况、送检要求等" data-field="remark" value="{{vehicle.remark}}" bindinput="onInput"/></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">保存车辆并选择检测类型</button><view class="hint">本阶段数据仅保存在当前微信设备，不会上传云端。</view></view>